  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n56 - [36 - {2 + 10 × (6 - 3)}] \n\n**Concept Used:**\n\nBODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/88177ffad2fcbcc1e586583dfb736971ed969abc894aa6c59e0b2c0dcfab3958.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n56 - [36 - {2 +10 × (6 - 3)}] \n\n⇒ 56 - [36 - {2 + 10 × (6 - 3)}] \n\n⇒ 56 - [36 - {2 + 10 × 3}] \n\n⇒ 56 - [36 - {2 + 30}] \n\n⇒ 56 - [36 - 32] \n\n⇒ 56 - 4\n\n⇒ 52",
